{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "042E", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-fppf-property-locally-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f085c18bd6fa181ea539b1371835d4a227d5844c479c0b7ec56da97a02d9b83f", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally separated''\nis fppf local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b47a35ea92682c73a9b111126659283e47abc9b86e791a494b97b0e5ec3a0367", "unit_id": "tag:042F:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "042E", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\{Y_i \\to Y\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$X_i := Y_i \\times_Y X \\to Y_i$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\Delta_i :\nX_i\n\\longrightarrow\nX_i \\times_{Y_i} X_i = Y_i \\times_Y (X \\times_Y X)\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\{Y_i \\times_Y (X \\times_Y X) \\to X \\times_Y X\\}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Delta_i$", "MATH_0009": "$\\Delta : X \\to X \\times_Y X$", "MATH_0010": "$\\Delta$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-base-change-separated}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-property-morphisms-local}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-topologies-lemma-fppf}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-descending-fppf-property-immersion}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bae9860dd5aeb53b6ae1793a09d08408beee78a4a534a0f19aefb54a1b8494a7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:36e8e281955ce0abc8ec29b60171d88c0339d13c020d941ee28c82232bcfb410", "source_text": "A base change of a locally separated morphism is locally separated, see\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nHence the direct implication in\nDefinition <REF_0002>.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nLet <MATH_0001> be an fppf covering of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0004>.\nAssume each base change <MATH_0005> is locally separated.\nThis means that each of the morphisms\n<MATH_0006>\nis an immersion. The base change of a fppf covering is an\nfppf covering, see\nTopologies on Spaces, Lemma <REF_0003>\nhence <MATH_0007>\nis an fppf covering of algebraic spaces. Moreover, each\n<MATH_0008> is the base change of the morphism\n<MATH_0009>. Hence it follows from\nLemma <REF_0004>\nthat <MATH_0010> is an immersion, i.e., <MATH_0011> is locally separated.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:423c038b71ea0f1d1c3bb6431d12658aa923b4acd59dc4f60e821cdf450ef129", "unit_id": "tag:042F:proof"}
